### Security & Local Configuration ###
# Prevents accidental commits of API keys, passwords, and local tokens
.env
.env.local
*.properties.local
*.yml.local
secret.properties

### Logs & Crashes ###
# Keeps runtime performance data and logs out of your git history
*.log
logs/
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

### OS Metadata ###
# Blocks hidden operating system configuration files
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

### Backup & Temporary Files ###
# Prevents automated editor backups from being tracked
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
*.orig
